WEBVTT

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:15.260
Please listen to me.

00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:16.220
--Mother!
--Mom!

00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:17.510
Huh?

00:01:54.400 --> 00:01:58.240
"Together Again"

00:01:58.240 --> 00:02:00.570
"Together Again"
Kasane. What did you just say?

00:02:00.570 --> 00:02:01.780
I said, "Mother."

00:02:01.780 --> 00:02:04.450
Yuito. Why did you say, "Mom"?

00:02:04.450 --> 00:02:07.330
How I've wanted to see you both.

00:02:07.330 --> 00:02:12.750
Don't be deceived.
It's a vision created by BABE.

00:02:12.750 --> 00:02:15.710
Wakana was a precious being.

00:02:15.710 --> 00:02:18.630
She had the power of the Red Strings.

00:02:18.630 --> 00:02:21.470
She was precious among
the Design Children.

00:02:21.470 --> 00:02:24.180
She was one of the Design Children?

00:02:24.180 --> 00:02:28.480
She was our hope for fulfilling
our dearest wish.

00:02:28.480 --> 00:02:31.810
And for you, Yuito, Kasane,

00:02:31.810 --> 00:02:34.770
she was someone dear to you.

00:02:34.770 --> 00:02:38.860
I heard Wakana was in charge
of raising Kasane.

00:02:38.860 --> 00:02:42.870
But then something happened
that made her defect.

00:02:42.870 --> 00:02:47.910
May your future be bright.

00:02:47.910 --> 00:02:54.340
So Wakana fled from Togetsu to Suoh
and met Chairman Sumeragi there?

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:57.460
He likely took her under
his wing to protect her.

00:02:57.460 --> 00:03:03.970
The chairman must have known
Wakana was from Togetsu.

00:03:03.970 --> 00:03:05.760
I'm shocked.

00:03:05.760 --> 00:03:08.220
It doesn't seem real.

00:03:08.220 --> 00:03:13.520
I took this form to reach out
to both of you.

00:03:13.520 --> 00:03:17.570
Yuito, Kasane. Surely you know by now.

00:03:17.570 --> 00:03:22.450
The Kunad Gate threatens
to destroy the whole world.

00:03:22.450 --> 00:03:27.740
I cannot save it without your help.

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:29.370
Our help?

00:03:29.370 --> 00:03:34.580
Yuito, forgive me for leaving you
when you were so young.

00:03:34.580 --> 00:03:37.630
But I will ease your sadness.

00:03:37.630 --> 00:03:41.470
Kasane, do you remember that puppy?

00:03:41.470 --> 00:03:44.430
Everyone will die if nothing is done.

00:03:44.430 --> 00:03:48.680
All of humanity will perish like that pup.

00:03:48.680 --> 00:03:52.810
I trust that you both will hear my plea.

00:04:07.370 --> 00:04:11.500
How dare you use my mom
in your twisted plan!

00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:15.750
You seek to erase the moon immigrants'
history and countless other lives!

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:17.840
My mother wouldn't want that!

00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:20.260
How absurd.

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:23.720
Your beloved Wakana's brain was restored

00:04:23.720 --> 00:04:27.100
and integrated within me.

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:28.680
What did you say?!

00:04:28.680 --> 00:04:32.390
They've built a human brain within BABE?!

00:04:32.390 --> 00:04:36.400
My mom wasn't attacked by an Other?

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:38.820
It was BABE? It was you people?!

00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:41.570
Togetsu did this to her?!

00:04:41.570 --> 00:04:44.490
It was all to save the world.

00:04:44.490 --> 00:04:49.620
What's this save the world BS?
You're just doing what's best for you!

00:04:49.620 --> 00:04:52.700
Using our mother like this won't help.

00:04:52.700 --> 00:04:55.670
You want to keep us from
going any farther, I take it?

00:04:55.670 --> 00:04:58.750
I won't let you use my mom anymore!

00:04:58.750 --> 00:05:01.630
We <i>will </i>shut BABE down!

00:05:06.970 --> 00:05:08.680
The gate again?!

00:05:08.680 --> 00:05:11.850
No, not this time!

00:05:11.850 --> 00:05:15.270
Everyone, run! The floor's collapsing!

00:05:17.900 --> 00:05:21.570
At last, Togetsu shows its true colors!

00:05:43.960 --> 00:05:45.760
Not again!

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:51.390
Tsugumi, is there anywhere
we could teleport?!

00:05:51.390 --> 00:05:54.600
No. This bridge is the only way out.

00:06:02.570 --> 00:06:04.940
Just keep running!

00:06:11.160 --> 00:06:13.080
--Yuito!
--On it!

00:06:18.670 --> 00:06:20.170
I got this!

00:06:34.100 --> 00:06:35.560
Looks like everyone's okay.

00:06:35.560 --> 00:06:37.430
That's a relief.

00:06:37.430 --> 00:06:38.730
Look!

00:06:40.560 --> 00:06:42.110
Faster!

00:07:02.170 --> 00:07:04.960
At least we didn't plummet to our deaths.

00:07:04.960 --> 00:07:07.380
It's done collapsing, right?

00:07:08.470 --> 00:07:09.880
Don't worry.

00:07:09.880 --> 00:07:12.430
This is BABE's main unit.

00:07:17.270 --> 00:07:22.560
We should have full access here.

00:07:22.560 --> 00:07:25.270
That includes shutting BABE down.

00:07:29.030 --> 00:07:31.490
What the...?

00:07:31.490 --> 00:07:33.070
What is it?

00:07:49.670 --> 00:07:53.680
For an instant, I felt something
like the Red Strings.

00:07:53.680 --> 00:07:56.300
Arashi, what's going on?

00:07:56.300 --> 00:08:01.020
I don't believe it.
It's an empty shell now.

00:08:01.020 --> 00:08:03.190
What do you mean, empty?

00:08:03.190 --> 00:08:04.940
I mean just that.

00:08:04.940 --> 00:08:09.860
Every bit of data was erased
without a trace.

00:08:09.860 --> 00:08:12.650
It feels like pure spite.

00:08:12.650 --> 00:08:18.580
Are you saying BABE gave up
and erased itself?

00:08:18.580 --> 00:08:24.040
Without BABE, Togetsu is utterly helpless.

00:08:24.040 --> 00:08:26.290
But Togetsu is annoyingly persistent.

00:08:26.290 --> 00:08:29.420
I doubt they're about
to give up so easily.

00:08:29.420 --> 00:08:31.550
It doesn't make sense,

00:08:31.550 --> 00:08:38.680
but it appears this computer complex
is now an empty pile of junk.

00:08:38.680 --> 00:08:39.970
Yeah.

00:08:40.970 --> 00:08:43.180
Hey! Everyone all right?!

00:08:43.180 --> 00:08:45.270
Is that you, Wataru?

00:08:45.270 --> 00:08:48.060
I guess they can't block comms anymore.

00:08:48.060 --> 00:08:51.780
It seems BABE really
has stopped functioning.

00:08:51.780 --> 00:08:55.610
I'm so glad you were able to stop it!

00:08:57.320 --> 00:09:00.410
The Kunad Gate just experienced
another data anomaly.

00:09:00.410 --> 00:09:03.410
It's becoming more frequent.

00:09:03.410 --> 00:09:06.370
I'm glad we thwarted Togetsu's plan,

00:09:06.370 --> 00:09:10.000
but the loss of all that data
was unfortunate.

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:13.920
There may have been information
about the Kunad Gate.

00:09:16.130 --> 00:09:18.640
Kagero, Kyoka.

00:09:18.640 --> 00:09:21.390
Do they store research data anywhere else?

00:09:21.390 --> 00:09:23.520
Is there anyone who might know more?

00:09:23.520 --> 00:09:27.730
Red Strings is a psionic power
steeped in mystery.

00:09:27.730 --> 00:09:31.150
I doubt there's anyone who
knows everything about it.

00:09:31.150 --> 00:09:35.570
That means we've hit a dead end.

00:09:36.700 --> 00:09:38.870
There might be someone.

00:09:38.870 --> 00:09:39.870
What?

00:09:39.870 --> 00:09:41.450
Wakana.

00:09:41.450 --> 00:09:45.460
She raised Kasane,
a wielder of the Red Strings.

00:09:45.460 --> 00:09:49.210
That means she had knowledge
pertaining to the Red Strings

00:09:49.210 --> 00:09:52.800
by virtue of her raising Kasane.

00:09:52.800 --> 00:09:56.220
What are you talking about?!
Wakana is already...

00:09:56.220 --> 00:09:57.630
He's right.

00:09:57.630 --> 00:09:58.680
Huh?

00:09:58.680 --> 00:10:01.470
We should go ask her ourselves.

00:10:08.730 --> 00:10:10.940
I don't remember it being that big.

00:10:10.940 --> 00:10:14.480
It's definitely growing.

00:10:14.480 --> 00:10:17.700
You're really going to use
the Red Strings?

00:10:17.700 --> 00:10:22.490
I am. This is the only hope we have now.

00:10:22.490 --> 00:10:27.790
Yeah, but won't it place a heavy load
on Yuito's brain again?

00:10:27.790 --> 00:10:30.960
If we do nothing,
the gate will continue to grow,

00:10:30.960 --> 00:10:33.630
and the world will
continue toward oblivion.

00:10:35.670 --> 00:10:40.390
We've got nothing to lose.
I want to do everything I can.

00:10:41.470 --> 00:10:45.470
Then we'll do whatever we can to help.

00:10:45.470 --> 00:10:49.390
So many things come to mind
now that we've made it this far.

00:10:50.690 --> 00:10:52.690
The Red Strings...

00:10:55.110 --> 00:10:57.490
I think we can do this.

00:10:57.490 --> 00:11:02.450
Yeah? I wish I could say the same.

00:11:02.450 --> 00:11:05.410
We'll support you via SAS.

00:11:05.410 --> 00:11:07.500
Great. Thanks.

00:11:07.500 --> 00:11:13.340
Do you have a date and place in mind?
One that will ensure you'll meet Wakana?

00:11:13.340 --> 00:11:15.880
October 4th, 2009.

00:11:15.880 --> 00:11:19.260
The old OSF Hospital in Lokusho City.

00:11:19.260 --> 00:11:21.970
We're sure to see her there.

00:11:21.970 --> 00:11:25.470
That's the day the Others
attacked Lokusho City.

00:11:27.350 --> 00:11:30.890
The day my mom died.

00:11:30.890 --> 00:11:34.980
Form a strong image of that
place and time in your mind.

00:11:34.980 --> 00:11:39.530
Okay, but I don't remember
much from back then.

00:11:46.160 --> 00:11:50.370
Don't worry. We're not alone.

00:11:50.370 --> 00:11:52.120
Everyone's here.

00:11:52.120 --> 00:11:54.790
Look who's all grown up.

00:11:54.790 --> 00:11:57.000
Like a certain someone.

00:11:57.000 --> 00:12:00.170
I'll be going to the past alone.

00:12:01.260 --> 00:12:02.470
Kasane?!

00:12:02.470 --> 00:12:04.890
Anyone other than the Red Strings user

00:12:04.890 --> 00:12:08.010
will be pulled back into
the present before long.

00:12:08.010 --> 00:12:11.770
The fewer people, the better,
considering the burden on the brain.

00:12:11.770 --> 00:12:14.650
No! I'm going, too!

00:12:14.650 --> 00:12:16.360
I can't let you go alone.

00:12:16.360 --> 00:12:17.730
Yes, you can.

00:12:17.730 --> 00:12:20.570
You can't risk meeting
your childhood self.

00:12:20.570 --> 00:12:25.370
No one knows what might happen if
two instances of the same person meet.

00:12:25.370 --> 00:12:29.410
It's all hypothetical,
but we should avoid such risks.

00:12:29.410 --> 00:12:32.330
Yeah, but having Kasane go alone...

00:12:32.330 --> 00:12:35.500
Didn't I just say we're not alone?

00:12:35.500 --> 00:12:38.090
Plus, you have the same power as I do.

00:12:38.090 --> 00:12:44.090
By having you here, you'll serve as
a waypost for me to return to this time.

00:12:44.090 --> 00:12:46.680
At least, I hope.

00:12:46.680 --> 00:12:48.930
I'm like your lighthouse?

00:12:48.930 --> 00:12:52.060
Fine. Just don't get in over your head.

00:12:52.060 --> 00:12:55.060
Yes, I promise.

00:12:55.060 --> 00:12:56.480
Let's get started.

00:13:41.690 --> 00:13:43.740
Hey! Are you all right?!

00:13:43.740 --> 00:13:45.990
Yuito, wake up!

00:13:45.990 --> 00:13:48.820
Yuito? Yuito!

00:13:54.290 --> 00:13:56.160
Yuito.

00:13:56.160 --> 00:13:58.290
Yuito?

00:13:58.290 --> 00:13:59.790
Yuito?

00:13:59.790 --> 00:14:01.090
Yuito!

00:14:02.670 --> 00:14:07.010
You did great, Yuito! You're so strong.

00:14:11.300 --> 00:14:13.640
Do you remember what today is?

00:14:13.640 --> 00:14:16.270
Yeah! I'm gonna have
a party with my friends!

00:14:16.270 --> 00:14:19.560
That's right. And you'll have
an amazing dinner!

00:14:19.560 --> 00:14:23.270
Plus, I have a special present for you.

00:14:23.270 --> 00:14:26.070
Really?! What is it?!

00:14:26.070 --> 00:14:28.070
You'll have to wait till tonight.

00:14:28.070 --> 00:14:29.200
What?

00:14:29.200 --> 00:14:30.570
You can't wait?

00:14:30.570 --> 00:14:32.030
Nope!

00:14:32.030 --> 00:14:35.700
Then how about playing with me till then?

00:14:35.700 --> 00:14:37.160
Okay!

00:14:38.210 --> 00:14:40.670
What do you think about the boy?

00:14:40.670 --> 00:14:43.880
He hasn't exhibited any signs of change.

00:14:43.880 --> 00:14:49.010
But the results of our dud treatment
vary dramatically between patients.

00:14:49.050 --> 00:14:50.180
"Exam Room Available"

00:14:50.260 --> 00:14:53.260
So Yuito really was a dud.

00:14:55.680 --> 00:14:57.930
Are you ready?

00:14:57.930 --> 00:14:59.940
Not yet!

00:14:59.940 --> 00:15:01.980
Don't go too far.

00:15:01.980 --> 00:15:03.940
I know!

00:15:03.940 --> 00:15:05.980
Ready!

00:15:07.110 --> 00:15:09.400
I wonder where he's hiding.

00:15:09.400 --> 00:15:13.120
Over here? Or maybe over here?

00:15:14.870 --> 00:15:16.830
Where could he be?

00:15:27.460 --> 00:15:29.880
I-I'm--

00:15:29.880 --> 00:15:31.840
I knew it was you, Kasane.

00:15:31.840 --> 00:15:32.930
Huh?

00:15:32.930 --> 00:15:37.930
One day it came out of the blue.
A memory from the future.

00:15:37.930 --> 00:15:42.770
I saw you after you
had arrived in Togetsu.

00:15:42.770 --> 00:15:46.900
Perhaps that proves BABE's
efforts had borne fruit.

00:15:46.900 --> 00:15:50.360
It finally demonstrated
the potential of the Red Strings.

00:15:50.360 --> 00:15:53.450
Mother, I don't understand.

00:15:53.450 --> 00:15:57.240
BABE's CPU is connected to
the brains of Red Strings users

00:15:57.240 --> 00:15:59.160
who have long since passed.

00:16:01.080 --> 00:16:04.380
None of them had power as great as you.

00:16:04.380 --> 00:16:09.260
But BABE used their brains
to produce quasi-Red Strings

00:16:09.260 --> 00:16:13.430
and send all the data back through time...

00:16:13.430 --> 00:16:16.430
...to the one with the power
of the Red Strings.

00:16:16.430 --> 00:16:19.060
Through time?! Don't tell me...!

00:16:19.060 --> 00:16:23.350
We were linked via my brain within BABE.

00:16:23.350 --> 00:16:27.150
And BABE's data was sent
to me back through time.

00:16:27.150 --> 00:16:28.940
Is that even possible?!

00:16:28.940 --> 00:16:34.530
It is. That's how I knew
you were alive and well.

00:16:34.530 --> 00:16:37.950
You're all grown up now, Kasane.

00:16:39.620 --> 00:16:43.120
But this is no time to reminisce.

00:16:43.120 --> 00:16:45.130
You don't have much time.

00:16:45.130 --> 00:16:46.920
Thank you, Mother.

00:16:46.920 --> 00:16:51.090
I need you to tell me whatever
you can about the Kunad Gate.

00:16:51.090 --> 00:16:55.340
Is Yuito's death really
the only way to eliminate it?

00:16:56.640 --> 00:16:58.510
Yes, that's right.

00:16:58.510 --> 00:17:03.390
As long as Yuito lives, the Kunad Gate
will continue to consume the world.

00:17:03.390 --> 00:17:04.980
But...

00:17:06.810 --> 00:17:10.360
That's why I have come prepared.

00:17:10.360 --> 00:17:14.700
If we're to take action, it must be now
while the Red Strings are manifest.

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:17.410
Take me to your time.

00:17:17.410 --> 00:17:20.410
Okay. All I have to do
is take you with me?

00:17:20.410 --> 00:17:23.620
Yes, but first...

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:27.290
I have a present for Yuito.

00:17:27.290 --> 00:17:29.630
It's finally finished.

00:17:29.630 --> 00:17:32.960
This device will protect him
from suffering memory loss.

00:17:32.960 --> 00:17:37.010
They're typically reserved
for certain patients,

00:17:37.010 --> 00:17:39.050
but I got this one special order.

00:17:39.050 --> 00:17:41.510
Yuito's ear cuff.

00:17:41.510 --> 00:17:46.600
He'll be fine once I replace
his old one with this.

00:17:46.600 --> 00:17:48.520
We can go after that.

00:17:50.150 --> 00:17:53.570
Where's she gonna go?!

00:17:53.570 --> 00:17:55.110
Emergency alert!

00:17:55.110 --> 00:17:57.820
Others are spawning over Lokusho City.

00:17:57.820 --> 00:18:01.280
Please evacuate to the nearest
shelter immediately.

00:18:03.580 --> 00:18:06.040
Yuito! Wait!

00:18:06.040 --> 00:18:07.250
Yuito!

00:18:29.060 --> 00:18:30.060
Yuito!

00:18:30.060 --> 00:18:31.900
Yuito! Where are you?!

00:18:31.900 --> 00:18:33.650
The shelter's this way!

00:18:33.650 --> 00:18:37.400
Everyone, remain calm
and proceed to the shelter!

00:18:37.400 --> 00:18:39.160
Is Yuito in the shelter?

00:18:40.820 --> 00:18:42.160
Mother!

00:18:49.540 --> 00:18:51.170
Are you okay?

00:18:51.170 --> 00:18:52.670
Yes.

00:18:52.670 --> 00:18:57.220
Togetsu. They'll do anything
to recover your brain.

00:19:01.220 --> 00:19:03.560
Mother, check the shelter.

00:19:03.560 --> 00:19:05.560
I'll look elsewhere.

00:19:05.560 --> 00:19:09.390
All right. But you take it.

00:19:09.390 --> 00:19:10.350
Why?

00:19:10.350 --> 00:19:13.400
I have a feeling it's for the best.

00:19:14.480 --> 00:19:16.650
Okay, I'll see you in a bit.

00:19:16.650 --> 00:19:18.280
All right.

00:19:18.280 --> 00:19:19.400
Yuito!

00:19:19.400 --> 00:19:21.700
Answer me!

00:19:29.040 --> 00:19:31.210
Yuito! Don't move!

00:19:53.150 --> 00:19:55.650
I was almost too late.

00:19:56.940 --> 00:19:58.070
Yuito.

00:19:58.070 --> 00:20:00.860
There's no time to explain.

00:20:00.860 --> 00:20:02.570
Let me put this on you.

00:20:02.570 --> 00:20:03.450
What?

00:20:03.450 --> 00:20:05.620
This is for you.

00:20:05.620 --> 00:20:08.450
It's a gift from your mom.

00:20:08.450 --> 00:20:10.620
Okay, thanks.

00:20:12.370 --> 00:20:14.540
Hold it for a second.

00:20:16.210 --> 00:20:18.420
Okay, I'll take that.

00:20:30.810 --> 00:20:32.890
You must live.

00:20:36.060 --> 00:20:39.150
What are you doing?!
Hurry up and evacuate!

00:20:39.150 --> 00:20:41.070
Take him somewhere safe.

00:20:41.070 --> 00:20:42.990
He's Joe Sumeragi's son.

00:20:44.780 --> 00:20:46.740
Understood!

00:20:46.740 --> 00:20:48.410
Thanks.

00:20:51.410 --> 00:20:53.500
All right, let's go.

00:21:02.670 --> 00:21:05.140
Hey, kid! You all right?

00:21:05.140 --> 00:21:08.470
Mother, I put your present on Yuito.

00:21:08.470 --> 00:21:11.220
Thank you, Kasane.

00:21:11.220 --> 00:21:12.480
Let's go.

00:21:12.480 --> 00:21:13.940
All right.

00:21:22.690 --> 00:21:25.280
M-Mommy.

00:21:25.280 --> 00:21:27.120
Mommy? Where are you going?!

00:21:27.120 --> 00:21:28.070
Mommy!

00:21:28.070 --> 00:21:29.910
Settle down!

00:21:31.790 --> 00:21:33.620
Mommy!

00:21:37.330 --> 00:21:41.170
Mommy!

00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:50.640
Yuito, are you okay?!

00:21:52.970 --> 00:21:55.140
I knew it was her.

00:21:55.140 --> 00:21:57.350
You must live.

00:22:01.270 --> 00:22:02.980
What's that?

00:22:05.820 --> 00:22:07.360
Mom!

00:22:16.410 --> 00:22:17.870
Yuito.

00:22:19.920 --> 00:22:22.380
I finally found you.

00:22:24.630 --> 00:22:26.340
Mom.

00:22:33.970 --> 00:22:41.770
<i>I've been a prisoner</i>
<i>of my own longing</i>

00:22:43.610 --> 00:22:51.410
<i>The shimmering heat signals me to halt</i>

00:22:51.410 --> 00:22:53.540
<i>There's a stranger in me</i>

00:22:53.540 --> 00:22:56.040
<i>I'll fly high so I won't be scared</i>

00:22:56.040 --> 00:23:01.290
<i>By this new self I've never seen</i>

00:23:01.290 --> 00:23:03.090
<i>I'm spreading my wings</i>

00:23:03.090 --> 00:23:05.420
<i>Bird in florid flight</i>

00:23:05.420 --> 00:23:10.140
<i>Lift your eyes to the scarlet sky</i>

00:23:10.140 --> 00:23:15.350
<i>Overtaken by the mighty wind</i>

00:23:15.350 --> 00:23:20.520
<i>The view unfolds upon a world</i>
<i>that begins turning</i>

00:23:20.520 --> 00:23:24.940
<i>Amid the intermingling light</i>

00:23:24.940 --> 00:23:30.860
<i>I keep searching for tomorrow</i>

00:23:30.860 --> 00:23:32.490
<i>Tomorrow's in your hands</i>

00:23:32.490 --> 00:23:35.700
<i>Don't tell me now you're afraid</i>

00:23:35.700 --> 00:23:37.330
<i>There's no time to waste</i>

00:23:37.330 --> 00:23:40.290
<i>Keep going forward</i>

00:23:40.290 --> 00:23:44.630
<i>There's nothing to be afraid of</i>

00:23:44.630 --> 00:23:46.300
<i>Now, let's go</i>

00:23:46.300 --> 00:23:51.760
<i>Into a brand-new day</i>

00:24:08.990 --> 00:24:11.860
"Wakana's Resolve"
